# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# /tables and /tables/<name> are client-side routes with no file behind them.
# Without this, a deep link or a refresh on one of those paths 404s before the
# app ever loads. The 200 (rather than a redirect) keeps the URL intact so the
# router still sees the path it needs to parse.
/*  /index.html  200
